 "voice": "am_eric",
 "script": "*Someday* isn't a day. || Look at your week. Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, all the way to Sunday. || ~Someday~ isn't on it. || Pick a *real* day. || One small thing. *Today.* || That's Dmyor. || Link's in the bio.",
 "spoken": "[hook] Someday isn't a day. || Seriously, look at your week. You've got Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, all the way through to Sunday. || And someday? It's not on there. And honestly, it never will be. || [turn] So here's what I'd do. Pick a real day, an actual date, and put your dream on it. || [land] And then, just do one small thing towards it. Today. || [outro] That's exactly what Dmyor is built for. || [outro] And if you want to try it out, I've put the link in the bio."
